    "work_id": "anf-works/nicene-creed",
    "canonical_ref": "Nicaea1.Creed.10.s1",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "And those who say There was a time when He was not, or that Before He was begotten He was not, or that He was made out of nothing;",
