    "work_id": "anf-works/nicene-creed",
    "canonical_ref": "Nicaea1.Creed.10.s2",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "or who say that The Son of God is of any other substance, or that He is changeable or unstable,—these the Catholic and Apostolic Church anathematizes.",
